Subject: [PATCH] WebRTC: dispatch statistics without blocking the main thread

Closing a PC sets webrtcbin to NULL and joins its task thread. A pending
get-stats promise must not wait synchronously for that main thread.
Keep the promise (and its reply/callback holder) alive until asynchronous
main-thread processing, and finish pending callbacks if the PC has closed.
Apply the same rule to optional statistics logging.

